      "name": "Canoptek Retinue",
      "rules": "At the start of the Declare Battle Formations step, this unit can join one other unit from your army that is being led by a **CRYPTEK** model (a unit cannot have more than one Tomb Crawlers unit joined to it and cannot have both a **TOMB CRAWLERS** and a **CRYPTOTHRALLS** unit joined to it). If it does, until the end of the battle, every model in this unit counts as being part of that Bodyguard unit, and that Bodyguard unit’s Starting Strength is increased accordingly.",
